mvtnorm-fortran is a derivative numerical port of the R package mvtnorm 1.4-2.

Upstream authors and contributors include Alan Genz, Frank Bretz, Tetsuhisa
Miwa, Xuefei Mi, Friedrich Leisch, Fabian Scheipl, Bjoern Bornkamp, Martin
Maechler, and Torsten Hothorn.

